     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Trap! Singular or plural",
     "texto": [
      "These words are **plural** in Danish:\n\n- **penge** (money), **kontanter** (cash), **møbler** (furniture), **oplysninger** (information)\n\nAnd these are **singular**: **saks** (scissors), **trappe** (stairs), **løn** (salary).\n\nSo: **flere** penge, **mere** løn."
